        "description": "Optical coherence tomography (OCT) showing subretinal drusen deposits",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of characteristic macular drusen deposits plus either a positive family history or identification of EFEMP1 mutation",
